@startuml

' ===== 字体与样式设置（确保论文打印清晰） =====
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontName SimHei
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam participantPadding 25
skinparam sequenceBoxBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam noteBorderColor #666666

' 使用黑白风格，避免打印后颜色失真
skinparam monochrome true

' ===== 参与者定义（减少为6个，去掉登录页） =====
actor "用户" as User
participant "用户信息页" as UserPage
participant "UserController" as Controller
participant "IUserService" as Service
participant "UserMapper" as Mapper
participant "MySQL数据库" as DB

' ===== 核心流程：查询用户信息（聚焦此模块） =====
autonumber 1
User -> UserPage: 访问用户信息页面
activate UserPage

autonumber 2
UserPage -> Controller: 调用 /user/getUserInfo/{userId} (GET)
activate Controller

autonumber 3
Controller -> Service: getUserInfoByUserId(userId)
activate Service

autonumber 4
Service -> Mapper: selectUserInfoByUserId(userId)
activate Mapper

autonumber 5
Mapper -> DB: 查询用户详情
activate DB
DB --> Mapper: 返回用户数据
deactivate DB

autonumber 6
Mapper --> Service: 返回用户信息
deactivate Mapper

' ===== 角色判断分支（简化表述） =====
autonumber 7
alt 管理员角色
    Service -> Mapper: selectAllUsers()
    activate Mapper
    Mapper -> DB: 执行全量查询
    activate DB
    DB --> Mapper: 返回全部用户列表
    deactivate DB
    Mapper --> Service: 返回用户列表
    deactivate Mapper
else 普通用户
    Service -> Service: 根据userId过滤当前用户
end

autonumber 8
Service --> Controller: 返回用户数据（ID/登录名/用户名/角色等）
deactivate Service

autonumber 9
Controller --> UserPage: 返回JSON响应
deactivate Controller

autonumber 10
UserPage --> User: 渲染用户信息表格
deactivate UserPage

' ===== 图注说明（放在下方，不挤占横向空间） =====
note over UserPage, Controller
  <b>前置条件：</b>用户已完成登录并携带有效Cookie/Token
end note

note over Service
  <b>RBAC权限控制</b>
  管理员 → 查询全部用户列表
  普通用户 → 仅返回自身信息
end note

@enduml
